# Python bytecode. apps/runner-ops ships .py helpers, and `pin_catalog_digests.py` imports
# `verify_catalog_digests` to share ONE digest definition — which materialises __pycache__ beside
# them. A .pyc carries NUL bytes, so committing one also trips the nul-census.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
